# Auth architecture freeze (production-proven)

Do **not** redesign OAuth, cookie Path/Domain, PKCE, or move auth authority client-side.

Keep:
- Official `@supabase/ssr` + Next 16 `src/proxy.ts`
- `getClaims` validation; proxy-owned refresh
- RSC read-only auth client (`setAll` no-op)
- Callback-owned session establishment
- **POST-only** logout (`GET /uitloggen` = 405 / non-mutating)
- Path=/; host-only apex cookies; SameSite=Lax; Secure/HttpOnly
- Idempotent customer/org bootstrap

Regression must preserve: Google login, hard nav, F5, close/reopen, explicit POST logout, no GET session mutation.

Worker: `vdbdigital-live-new` only. No new Worker / domain remap / Vercel auth path.
